# Second half: everything from the first run is restored, including the ducks (already seen, so
# they are simply there).
expect count coop 1
expect item @34,30 coop
expect rain on
expect muted yes
expect phase dusk
expect seen duck
expect undo no
expect present duck 3
# No news of the ducks again; the muted world says how to unmute, once.
expect toast not New visitor
expect toast sound is off
wait 30
shot shots/reloaded.png
quit
